{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>秀茂坪今日（11日）有人懷疑猝死。下午4時08分，警方接獲一名男子報案，指其43歲姓李妻子，在曉光街21號曉麗苑住房在房間床上暈倒。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，李婦昏迷被送往聯合醫院搶救，其後被證實死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。據了解，李婦有身體病錄。</p><figure><img alt=\"秀茂坪曉麗苑一婦人昏迷床上，送院不治。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220911/645757556265848832639108.jpeg/fP_2uN8nvsQ8fkgIeP5T6IXE_Zj5LnpXwD_wVcA_8FU\"/><figcaption>秀茂坪曉麗苑一婦人昏迷床上，送院不治。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T12:17:48.562742+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T11:56:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T03:21:28.248862+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T12:11:21.156810+00:00","content_hash":"3972c5da90c203f344ff9293e4ec20e28e0093b1c387bd7e1e67517fd98c710a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}